From 3f33cb4c56684df1003f74dc7d37b6ed6b4b356f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:01:54 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Mabar: announce LAN worlds on every network, hotspot
 included

The multicast group only leaves by the default network, so a world opened to
LAN was not heard over a phone's hotspot. The announcement now also goes to
each network's broadcast address from that network's own address, and the
scanner joins the group on every network.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
